usage: apport-bug [options] [symptom|pid|package|program path|.apport/.crash file]

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  -w, --window   Click a window as a target for filing a problem report.
  --hanging      The provided pid is a hanging application.
  --save PATH    In bug filing mode, save the collected information into a
                 file instead of reporting it. This file can then be reported
                 later on from a different machine.
  --tag TAGS     Add an extra tag to the report. Can be specified multiple
                 times.
  -v, --version  Print the Apport version number.
